# 2. Department Model
All municipal offices must belong to a single dynamic `Department` system.
Example department:
- Name: `Human Resource Management Office`
- Acronym: `HRMO`
- Slug: `hrmo`
- Short Description
- Body / About
- Department Head
- Department Image
- Active Status
- Optional display/sort order
Use the existing Department model if possible and extend it where necessary.
A possible structure could resemble:
```text
Department
id
name
acronym
slug
short_description
body
image_url
department_head_id
is_active
sort_order
created_at
updated_at
```
Follow the project's existing naming conventions and ORM/database architecture.
The slug must be unique.
