# 5. Do Not Make Departments User Roles
Departments and application roles must be separate concepts.
Do NOT create roles such as:
```text
HRMO
MPDC
ASSESSOR
RHU
ENGINEERING
TREASURER
```
Department names must never be added into the application role enum.
Roles should represent permission levels.
For example:
```text
SUPERADMIN
EDITOR
LEGISLATIVE_EDITOR
```
Only retain `LEGISLATIVE_EDITOR` if it is actually required by the existing architecture.
A user's office assignment must instead reference the Department table.
Example:
```text
role = EDITOR
department_id = <HRMO department ID>
```
Conceptually:
```text
User
 ├── role
 └── department_id
          ↓
      Department
```
